    "html": "{{ @header }}\r\n<!-- reviews -->\r\n<div class=\"space-top-3\" style=\"background: #e8e8e9\">\r\n  <div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class='pt-5 pb-5'>\r\n      <div class=\"row\">\r\n          <div class=\"col-12 col-md-5\">\r\n            <div class=\"heading mb-4\" style=\"color:#5d5d5d;font-family: 'Chivo', sans-serif;font-weight: 900;line-height: 1.2; font-size:40px;\">\r\n              First Academy <br> Reviews\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"p-1 rounded mb-4\" style=\"width:10%;background:#70bce1\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"heading2 mb-4\" style=\"color:#5d5d5d;font-family: 'Chivo', sans-serif;font-weight: 900;line-height: 1.5; font-size:20px;\">\r\n              Hear what our students have<br> to say about us\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"heading2 mb-2\" style=\"color:#fd6b23\">\r\n              <i class=\"fa fa-star fa-2x\"><\/i> <i class=\"fa fa-star fa-2x\"><\/i> <i class=\"fa fa-star fa-2x\"><\/i> <i class=\"fa fa-star fa-2x\"><\/i> <i class=\"fa fa-star fa-2x\"><\/i>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"text-secondary mb-5\"> 4.9 average from 1415 reviews on google\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"col-12 col-md-7\">\r\n            <div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9\">\r\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/59V5w_5R5rM?showinfo=0\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\r\n<\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n  <!-- Review -->\r\n  <div class=\"container pt-md-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"row pt-md-5\">\r\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 pt-10 mt-10 mt-md-0 pt-md-0\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&meghana.jpg}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Meghana Chowdary<\/span>\r\n                <p><small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">IELTS: 7.5, December 2017<\/small><\/p>   \r\n                <p>I would rather call it sahithy academy for ielts\u2026she supported me to achieve band 7.5 vthin 20days\u2026not only she,all d other staff are very friendly nd help u in all d aspects during ur course especially teju and Divya \u2026.I would surely recommend FA for Everyone.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n     <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&ali.jpg}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Syed Mujahid Akbar Ali<\/span>\r\n             <p> <small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">GRE : 320<\/small><\/p>                  \r\n                <p>The classes are top notch. The examples and quizzes help us learn effectively. Despite work I was still able to cope with the GRE training and got a great score. The consulting package was absolutely hassle free! Special thanks to Teju, Sahiti, Bhanu, and others for helping me.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n     <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&Himantej.png}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Himantej Reddy<\/span>\r\n \r\n                <p><small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">Got his USA Visa in a Month<\/small>        <p>                \r\n                <p>Awesome experience.!! Great mentors.!! Highly recommended for those who are planning to do their masters in Usa,Australia and Canada.!! Coaching on gre and ielts was awesome. Cheers to the whole team (sahithy mam n teju sir). Not but not the least i have to tell abt bhanu mam She guided me a lot and u knw what i got my USA #visa_in_1month ????\u2026.Thank u soo much mam. I would recommend this acedemy if u wanna go abroad for higher studies\u2026 (5\/5)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n     <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&divyareddy.png}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Divya Reddy<\/span>\r\n \r\n                <p><small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">IELTS Student<\/small> <\/p>                  \r\n                <p>Right place to land if you are looking for an IELTS institute.Great faculty, friendly staff and Unlike other institutes First Academy provides a demo class and their own material, that says it all.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n     <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&manisha.png}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Manisha Pasupunoori<\/span>\r\n \r\n                <p> <small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">IELTS Student<\/small>  <\/p>                \r\n                <p>Thanks for your support first academy\u2026 Mainly thanks to divya and sahity.. They helps a lot to reach my Ielts score.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n     <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&janardhan.jpg}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Janardhan Alluri<\/span>\r\n \r\n                <p> <small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">PTE<\/small>  <\/p>                \r\n                <p>It\u2019s so nice to be part of First Academy. I have taken training for PTE. It was so nice. They teach really well! Five Stars.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n     <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&vineel.jpg}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Vineel Vardhan<\/span>\r\n \r\n                <p> <small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">Facebook Review<\/small>  <\/p>                \r\n                <p>I have been told there are a very few good consultancies to approach, if u want to get into a good university. First academy definitely qualifies to be in the top tier consultancies.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n     <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&siddartha.jpg}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Siddartha Mettupalle<\/span>\r\n \r\n                <p> <small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">Facebook Review<\/small>  <\/p>                \r\n                <p>First Academy is a wonderful place for those who want to pursue Master\u2019s abroad. I would like to thank the whole team of First Academy, without whom this process would be very difficult. I thank Sahithy, Teju, Ravali and Bhanu mam for the help while processing my applications.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&narendra.png}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Makkapati Narendra<\/span>\r\n \r\n                <p> <small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">\r\nIELTS Student<\/small>  <\/p>                \r\n                <p>BEST PLACE TO GET KNOWLEDGE FOR IELTS EXAM<br>BEST FACULTY FOR IELTS SAHITHY.<br>\r\nBest consultancy for career counseling. They helped me getting my required score in IELTS..<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"media pb-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"avatar avatar-circle mr-3\">\r\n                <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"{{&ram.jpg}}\" alt=\"Image Description\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"media-body\">\r\n                <span class=\"h4\">Ram Kandittu<\/span>\r\n                <p> <small class=\"mr-2 p-1 bg-success text-white fw-bold rounded\">GRE & IELTS<\/small>  <\/p>                \r\n                <p>I have done my GRE and IELTS coaching and admission process in this institute and the institute members helped me a lot. The institute members are very caring \u2026<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n{{ @footer }}",
